<amll:meta key="artists" value="持修"/>
<amll:meta key="album" value="艾·思集"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1863898438"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:27.920"><div begin="20.153" end="35.414" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.153" end="22.270" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.153" end="21.395">洞穴里住着</span><span begin="21.395" end="22.270">美人</span></p><p begin="22.455" end="25.270" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.455" end="24.314">她听不到凡尘的议论</span><span begin="24.314" end="25.270">纷纷</span></p><p begin="30.017" end="32.174" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.017" end="31.052">没有窗</span><span begin="31.052" end="32.174">户 没有门</span></p><p begin="32.495" end="35.414" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.495" end="33.490">没有镜</span><span begin="33.490" end="34.285">像 不需要</span><span begin="34.285" end="34.634">自</span><span begin="34.634" end="35.414">证</span></p></div><div begin="39.929" end="55.653" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="39.929" end="42.368" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.929" end="42.368">顶得住舆论 顶不住自然</span></p><p begin="42.398" end="44.767" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.398" end="44.767">盼人情冷暖 但怕环境摧残</span></p><p begin="45.147" end="47.264" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.147" end="46.029">也怕狂风</span><span begin="46.029" end="46.814">骤雨的夜</span><span begin="46.814" end="47.264">晚</span></p><p begin="47.274" end="49.613" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.274" end="48.958">难免蜷缩着 约会久违的</span><span begin="48.958" end="49.613">缺憾</span></p><p begin="49.623" end="50.496" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.623" end="50.496">再叹</span></p><p begin="53.211" end="55.653" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.211" end="54.869">原来也有美好 在那</span><span begin="54.869" end="55.653">端</span></p></div><div begin="58.322" end="1:18.490" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="58.322" end="1:02.233" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.322" end="59.317">她刺穿了</span><span begin="59.317" end="1:00.090">心</span> <span begin="1:00.090" end="1:01.026">任血液</span><span begin="1:01.026" end="1:02.233">瀑布般流</span></p><p begin="1:02.503" end="1:04.788" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.503" end="1:03.383">不信真相是</span><span begin="1:03.383" end="1:04.788">海市蜃楼</span></p><p begin="1:04.915" end="1:07.072" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.915" end="1:06.399">她要归还所有好心人的</span><span begin="1:06.399" end="1:07.072">迁就</span></p><p begin="1:07.362" end="1:11.095" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.362" end="1:07.926">她要自</span><span begin="1:07.926" end="1:08.461">由</span> <span begin="1:08.461" end="1:09.156">她决定</span> <span begin="1:09.156" end="1:09.710">跑</span> <span begin="1:10.439" end="1:11.095">跑</span></p><p begin="1:11.817" end="1:16.382" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.817" end="1:12.754">就任性一</span><span begin="1:12.754" end="1:13.307">次</span> <span begin="1:13.307" end="1:14.088">扔下孤</span><span begin="1:14.088" end="1:15.071">傲 跑</span> <span begin="1:15.645" end="1:16.382">跑</span></p><p begin="1:16.569" end="1:18.490" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.569" end="1:17.272">她在闪</span><span begin="1:17.272" end="1:18.490">耀</span></p></div><div begin="1:19.867" end="1:40.236" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="1:19.867" end="1:22.688" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.867" end="1:20.753">就像狼群总</span><span begin="1:20.753" end="1:21.950">追溯着气</span><span begin="1:21.950" end="1:22.688">味</span></p><p begin="1:24.800" end="1:27.779" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:24.800" end="1:25.726">就像森林总</span><span begin="1:25.726" end="1:26.926">离不开河</span><span begin="1:26.926" end="1:27.779">水</span></p><p begin="1:28.480" end="1:34.319" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:28.480" end="1:29.393">她好奇</span><span begin="1:29.393" end="1:30.311">外</span><span begin="1:30.311" end="1:31.428">面的</span><span begin="1:31.428" end="1:32.521">世界</span> <span begin="1:32.721" end="1:34.319">会不会失望</span></p><p begin="1:34.329" end="1:40.236" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:34.329" end="1:35.125">剩</span><span begin="1:35.125" end="1:37.590">下的时间</span> <span begin="1:37.712" end="1:40.236">会不会再次崩塌</span></p></div><div begin="1:39.780" end="1:58.805" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:39.780" end="1:41.938" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.780" end="1:41.938">任血液瀑布般流</span></p><p begin="1:42.073" end="1:44.358" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.073" end="1:42.953">不信真相是</span><span begin="1:42.953" end="1:44.358">海市蜃楼</span></p><p begin="1:44.556" end="1:46.993" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.556" end="1:46.040">她要归还所有好心人的</span><span begin="1:46.040" end="1:46.993">迁就</span></p><p begin="1:47.005" end="1:50.738" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.005" end="1:47.569">她要自</span><span begin="1:47.569" end="1:48.104">由</span> <span begin="1:48.104" end="1:48.799">她决定</span> <span begin="1:48.799" end="1:49.353">跑</span> <span begin="1:50.082" end="1:50.738">跑</span></p><p begin="1:51.598" end="1:56.128" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.598" end="1:52.813">任性一次</span><span begin="1:52.813" end="1:54.021">扔下孤傲</span> <span begin="1:54.085" end="1:54.775">跑</span> <span begin="1:55.335" end="1:56.128">跑</span></p><p begin="1:56.138" end="1:58.805" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.138" end="1:56.931">她终于闪</span><span begin="1:56.931" end="1:58.805">耀</span></p></div><div begin="1:58.815" end="2:34.775" itunes:songPart="Bridge" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="1:58.815" end="2:05.227" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:58.815" end="1:59.091">她</span><span begin="1:59.091" end="2:00.894">不想要</span><span begin="2:01.234" end="2:04.096">再做任何反抗现实的挣</span><span begin="2:04.096" end="2:05.227">扎</span></p><p begin="2:08.634" end="2:15.002" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:08.634" end="2:09.032">她</span><span begin="2:09.032" end="2:09.788">不</span><span begin="2:09.788" end="2:10.841">需要</span><span begin="2:11.102" end="2:14.020">再拿出本已经丢失的筹</span><span begin="2:14.020" end="2:15.002">码</span></p><p begin="2:15.489" end="2:20.758" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:15.489" end="2:16.329">别怕把</span><span begin="2:16.329" end="2:18.810">手伸出车</span><span begin="2:18.810" end="2:20.758">窗</span></p><p begin="2:21.007" end="2:24.631" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:21.007" end="2:23.794">反正没人知道明天会怎</span><span begin="2:23.794" end="2:24.631">样</span></p><p begin="2:25.290" end="2:31.116" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:25.290" end="2:26.282">最后的</span><span begin="2:26.282" end="2:28.770">她笑而不</span><span begin="2:28.770" end="2:31.116">答</span></p><p begin="2:30.843" end="2:34.775" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:30.843" end="2:33.036">天上飞的鸟儿都化</span><span begin="2:33.036" end="2:34.775">成土壤</span></p></div><div begin="2:37.163" end="2:53.695" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="2:37.163" end="2:40.798" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:37.163" end="2:39.551">喔 从前从前 洞穴里</span><span begin="2:39.551" end="2:40.798">住着美人</span></p><p begin="2:41.074" end="2:43.889" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:41.074" end="2:42.750">她听不到凡尘的议论</span><span begin="2:42.750" end="2:43.889">纷纷</span></p><p begin="2:46.975" end="2:50.610" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:46.975" end="2:49.363">喔 从前从前 洞穴里</span><span begin="2:49.363" end="2:50.610">住着美人</span></p><p begin="2:50.880" end="2:53.695" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:50.880" end="2:52.739">她听不到凡尘的议论</span><span begin="2:52.739" end="2:53.695">纷纷</span></p></div><div begin="2:58.481" end="3:17.335" itunes:songPart="Outro" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="2:58.481" end="3:04.027" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:58.481" end="2:59.342">当</span><span begin="2:59.493" end="3:01.594">阳光</span> <span begin="3:01.780" end="3:02.775">翻越那座</span><span begin="3:02.775" end="3:04.027">山头</span></p><p begin="3:04.411" end="3:06.852" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:04.411" end="3:05.929">你不再沉</span><span begin="3:05.929" end="3:06.852">默</span></p><p begin="3:08.336" end="3:13.974" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:08.336" end="3:09.518">当</span><span begin="3:09.518" end="3:11.428">雨水</span> <span begin="3:11.648" end="3:12.715">灌溉这片</span><span begin="3:12.715" end="3:13.974">沙漠</span></p><p begin="3:14.279" end="3:17.335" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:14.279" end="3:15.673">你望向</span><span begin="3:15.673" end="3:17.335">我</span></p></div></body></tt>